  "page_markdown": "[\n!\n ](https://traveldevils.in)\n\n- [Home](https://traveldevils.in/)\n- [Upcoming Trips](https://traveldevils.in/upcoming-trips/)\n- [International Trips](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/)\n- [Backpacking Trips](https://traveldevils.in/backpacking-trips/)\n- [Corporate Trip](https://traveldevils.in/corporate-trip/)\n- [About Us](https://traveldevils.in/about-us/)\n- [Contact Us](https://traveldevils.in/contact-us/)\n- [My Account](https://traveldevils.in/my-account/)\nX\n\n!\n\n [ Overview ](#)\n [ Itinerary ](#)\n [ Inclusion/Exclusion ](#)\n\n##  [ Overview ](#)\n\n##  [ Itinerary ](#)\n\n##  [ Inclusion/Exclusion ](#)\n\n## Overview\n\nThe two places are approximately 50-60 km from each other, making them an ideal trip for pilgrims and nature lovers. Mukteshwar is famous for its 350-year-old Shiva temple and panoramic views of the Himalayas, while Kainchi Dham is home to the ashram of Neem Karoli Baba, known for its serenity.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Kainchi Dham\n- Balugarh Waterfall\n- Chowli ki jaali\n- Mukteshwar Temple\n- Nainital / Bhimtal\n\n## Itinerary\n\n Expand all\n\n Day 01 :\n  Arrival in Mukteshwar\n\nMorning: Arrive in Mukteshwar and check into your camps or rooms.\nAfternoon: Head out for a short 1.5 km hike to a local waterfall. After the hike, visit Chauli ki Jali and the Mukteshwar Temple, renowned for their breathtaking views and cultural significance.\nEvening: Return to your accommodation for a relaxing bonfire and music session. Dinner will be served, followed by an overnight stay.\n\n Day 02 :\n  Adventure and Sightseeing\n\nMorning: After breakfast, check out and engage in thrilling adventure activities.\nAfternoon: Visit Kainchi Dham, a revered site known for its spiritual ambiance. Later, proceed to either Nainital or Bhimtal for some leisurely sightseeing.\nEvening: Depart for Delhi at 9:00 PM.\nNext Day Early Morning: Arrival in Delhi\n\n##\n\n### Inclusions\n\n- Round-trip transfers from Delhi.\n- One-night accommodation in Swiss camps or rooms.\n- Meals: One breakfast, one dinner, and an evening high tea.\n- Sightseeing as per the itinerary.\n- Bonfire and music evening.\n- Enthusiastic and experienced trip captain.\n\n### Exclusions\n\n- Any personal Expenses / Adventure activities.\n- Anything not mentioned in the itinerary.\n- Any kind of entry tickets / fees.\n- Any Meals & Drinks other than Inclusion.\n- 5% GST Extra\n\n-  [    Date & Time    ](#wte-booking-datetime)\n-  [    Package Type    ](#wte-booking-packages)\n\n   Back  Continue\n\n  From   ₹4999\n/ Quad Sharing\n  From   ₹5399\n/ Dual Sharing\n  From   ₹5199\n/ Triple Sharing\n\n   Check Availability\n\n## Useful Links\n\n-  [ Home ](https://traveldevils.in/)\n-  [ Upcoming Trips ](https://traveldevils.in/upcoming-trips/)\n-  [ International Trips ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/)\n-  [ Domestic Trips ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/)\n-  [ About Us ](https://traveldevils.in/about-us/)\n-  [ Contact Us ](https://traveldevils.in/contact-us/)\n\n## Unique Links\n\n-  [ Privacy Policy ](https://traveldevils.in/privacy-policy-2/)\n-  [ Terms & Conditions ](https://traveldevils.in/terms-conditions/)\n-  [ Return Policy ](https://traveldevils.in/return-policy/)\n-  [ Refund Process ](https://traveldevils.in/refund-policy/)\n-  [ Cancallation Policy  ](https://traveldevils.in/cancellation-policy/)\n\n## Domestic Trip\n\n-  [ Rajasthan ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/rajasthan/)\n-  [ Meghalaya ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/meghalaya/)\n-  [ Ladakh ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/ladakh/)\n-  [ Sikkim ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/sikkim/)\n-  [ Delhi ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/delhi/)\n-  [ Goa ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/goa/)\n-  [ Himachal ](https://traveldevils.in/domestic-trip/himachal/)\n\n## International Trip\n\n-  [ Bali ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/bali/)\n-  [ Bhutan ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/bhutan/)\n-  [ Dubai ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/dubai/)\n-  [ Sri Lanka ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/sri-lanka/)\n-  [ India ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/india/)\n-  [ Vietnam ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/vietnam/)\n-  [ Thailand ](https://traveldevils.in/international-trips/thailand/)\n\n!\n\n## Travel Devils\n\n-  +91 70428 52209\n-  info@traveldevils.in\n\n-\n-\n\n© 2026 Travel Devils All rights reserved.\n\nWhatsApp us\n",
