      "trip_code": "WTE-2886",
      "overview": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The two places are approximately 50-60 km from each other, making them an ideal trip for pilgrims and nature lovers. Mukteshwar is famous for its 350-year-old Shiva temple and panoramic views of the Himalayas, while Kainchi Dham is home to the ashram of Neem Karoli Baba, known for its serenity. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
