          "title": "Arrival in Mukteshwar",
          "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Morning: Arrive in Mukteshwar and check into your camps or rooms.<br>Afternoon: Head out for a short 1.5 km hike to a local waterfall. After the hike, visit Chauli ki Jali and the Mukteshwar Temple, renowned for their breathtaking views and cultural significance.<br>Evening: Return to your accommodation for a relaxing bonfire and music session. Dinner will be served, followed by an overnight stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
